+/**
+ * @brief   Stores an independent copy of a T39DefaultJson value.
+ *
+ * This class allows a T39DefaultJson value to be stored independent of its original
+ * document. T39DefaultJson makes this easy to do, as it does not perform any
+ * custom memory management.
